    context: "Assisi's merchant class was rising against the old feudal nobility; Francis fought in an inter-city war and was imprisoned before his conversion. The Fourth and Fifth Crusades framed his adult life — his meeting with the Sultan happened in the middle of the Fifth Crusade's siege of Damietta.",
